# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project-specific additions (everything above is GitHub's Python template, unmodified)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# JVM crash reports from the embedded Deephaven server, and the messages of its fatal errors
# (tests/conftest.py). A crash is a bug: investigate it.
hs_err_pid*.log
jvm_fatal_pid*.log

# Claude Code: the shared settings and hooks are committed; local settings and agent
# worktrees are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# uv.lock is not committed: users never install from it, and every sync resolves the newest
# versions.
uv.lock

# An interrupted `refresh --fetch` leaves its staging or backup directory beside the snapshot.
vendor/massive-incoming/
vendor/massive-previous/

# The output and evidence of live integration runs (docs/live-tests.md): they hold raw licensed
# rows, so they are never committed.
live-checks.log
live-evidence-*.log
# The DEBUG log of each pytest run that selected a live test (tests/_live/debug_log_file.py).
live-debug-logs/
# The plans the live tests probed today; it names the key only by a digest.
.live-plans.json

# Extra project environments, such as the free-threaded one (UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT=.venv-314t).
.venv-*/
